      "q": "How much does Department of Homeland Security spend on contracts?",
      "a": "The Department of Homeland Security obligated $57.6B on contracts in FY2026 to date. The Department of Homeland Security issued 22,141 awards with an average award size of $2.6M, and obligations are up 103.5% year over year."
