    {
      "q": "What does Homeland Security buy?",
      "a": "The Department of Homeland Security buys a mix of construction, maritime, security, logistics, and IT services. Commercial and Institutional Building Construction received $28.5B, Ship Building and Repairing received $7.7B, Security Guards and Patrol Services received $3.4B, and Computer Systems Design Services received $1.7B."
